The read-only graphics-buffer extension retains the same source-derived buffer
ownership, descriptor and command synchronization seams. PentaX supplies exact
owned per-stage uploads at vertex binding0 and pixel binding57, actual physical
limits, full stage push-layout checks and read barriers. Pipelines retain each
buffer borrow until fence/drain completion. No new shader source, stores,
optional Vulkan feature, descriptor indexing or allocation-cap increase is
introduced. The primary resource-count contracts are:
https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/limits.html
https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/descriptorsets.html
